01:52:09.671 --> 01:52:30.231
<v SPEAKER_2>Yes, I'm very apolitical and people tell me I'm not, but I genuinely am. And I have I know I am because folks on the right and left of politics both tell me a lot of different stuff. I get emails from all over folks in the United States, folks from Europe, folks from the UK. I just no matter who you vote for, the government gets in and that's what happens.

